==English==

===Etymology===
Named after the [[Ebola]] River.

===Noun===
{{en-noun|head=[[Ebola]] [[fever]]|-}}

# {{context|disease|lang=en}} An extremely contagious and often fatal illness caused by the [[Ebola virus]], characterised by [[fever]] and internal bleeding, contracted through infected body fluids.

